      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/mujam-al-ahadith-al-mutabara:4:5:8",
      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/9/4/5/8",
      "text": [
        ": سألت أبا عبد الله عليه السلام هل يكون اليوم شئ لم يكن في علم الله عزوجل؟ قالا: لا بل كان في علمه قبل أن ينشئ السماوات والارض"
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.ammaar-muslim": [
          "8. [8/345] al-Tawhid: Ibn Idris from his father from al-Ash’ari from Ali b. Ismail and Ibn Hashim from Safwan from Ibn Hazim who said: I asked Aba Abdillah عليه السلام - Does there happen something today which was not in the knowledge of Allah Mighty and Majestic? He said: No. Rather it was in His knowledge before He generated the Heavens and the Earth."
        ]
      }
